00:56:10,833 --> 00:56:15,333
ラッキーの天秤の裏側にあるアンラッキー
Bad luck lies on the flip side of luck's scales.

668
00:56:15,333 --> 00:56:19,133
転んだって泣いたって僕ら立ち上がる
Even if we fall or cry, we'll stand right back up.

669
00:56:19,133 --> 00:56:21,133
七転八倒さ
We fall seven times and get up eight!

670
00:56:21,133 --> 00:56:23,633
笑ってくれてありがとう！
Thank you for smiling with me!

671
00:56:23,633 --> 00:56:26,233
まだ僕は走れるよ
I can still keep running.

672
00:56:26,233 --> 00:56:29,833
人生の期待感は
My expectations for life

673
00:56:29,833 --> 00:56:32,433
正直膨らむばっかでさ
honestly just keep growing,

674
00:56:32,433 --> 00:56:37,233
君の心の中灯るひだまりなのです
becoming a warm sunny spot lit in your heart.

675
00:56:37,233 --> 00:56:41,333
僕らが暮らしてる奇跡の時代
In this miraculous era we live in,

676
00:56:41,333 --> 00:56:45,033
君のコトどう照らすかな
I wonder how it will shine upon you.

677
00:56:45,033 --> 00:56:50,433
星より煌めいた僕らしい太陽になれたら
If I could become a sun true to myself, shining brighter than the stars...

678
00:56:50,433 --> 00:56:54,033
不確かな永遠より
Rather than an uncertain eternity,

679
00:56:54,033 --> 00:56:58,133
僕は二人で過ごす今を楽しんでいたい
I want to enjoy the present we spend together.

680
00:56:58,133 --> 00:57:00,433
この惑星の片隅
In a corner of this planet,

681
00:57:00,433 --> 00:57:03,733
続くあいまいミーゆえにダンシング
an ambiguous "me" continues, so keep dancing!

682
00:57:03,733 --> 00:57:07,333
ああ健やかな時も
Ah, whether in times of health,

683
00:57:07,333 --> 00:57:11,133
ああ病める時も
ah, or in times of sickness,

684
00:57:11,133 --> 00:57:14,933
きっと伝えたいよこのメロディー
I definitely want to convey this melody to you.

685
00:57:14,933 --> 00:57:18,633
僕らが出会えた奇跡のセカイ
In this miraculous world where we met,

686
00:57:18,633 --> 00:57:22,433
君の目にどう映るかな
I wonder how it looks in your eyes.

687
00:57:22,433 --> 00:57:24,922
青より澄み渡る僕だけの大空だといいな
I hope it's a clear sky just for me, even bluer than blue.

688
00:57:25,133 --> 00:59:00,133
これからも、楽しい事いっぱい一緒にしようね！
Let's keep doing lots of fun things together!

